-- India district boundaries, part 3 of 5: 129 districts.
--
-- Split because Supabase's SQL editor refuses a single statement batch this
-- large. Run the parts in any order; each is idempotent on its own and the
-- set is complete only when all 5 have run.
--
-- Source:  DataMeet maps, https://github.com/datameet/maps/tree/master/Districts
-- Licence: CC BY 2.5 IN, carried in the table so a report can cite it.
--
-- Geometry simplified to about a kilometre with PostGIS
-- ST_SimplifyPreserveTopology — invisible at the zoom a national choropleth
-- is read at, and unlike ogr2ogr's -simplify it does not delete small
-- districts outright.
--
-- Depends on: ward-density.sql (run that first, it creates the table).
-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

